00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:17.430
Hi John! Hi John! Hi John! Hi John! Hi John!
This is making my balls cold! Hi John! Howdy

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:26.369
Johnny-boy! Hi… John… I guess? Good morning,
John! It’s Wednesday, January 31st.

