The University of Georgia’s mascot is a
bulldog, so they covered the town of Athens

00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:33.160
with bulldogs, and I covered their bulldogs
with myself. That’s a pretty normal thing

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:35.590
