00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:42.050
In keeping with the tradition of movie magic-ing,
that was actually not filmed today, nor was

00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:47.010
it filmed yesterday. It was filmed on the
day of my last video, but I had already filmed

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:53.640
the intro for that day in Asheville, so I
had to use that day’s footage for today’s

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:58.800
intro. So I’m not actually in Athens anymore;
I’m in Orlando, Florida. Welcome to Orlando,

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:03.280
where everything sucks. Okay, not everything
sucks or else I wouldn’t be here, right?

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:06.270
So the people, some of them, are very cool.

00:01:06.270 --> 00:01:13.220
John Green, as you are playing the Nintendo
Wii, I can only assume that you have finished

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:18.000
your first draft of your book. Because there
is no way you’re gonna finish your first

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:22.470
draft of your book after you get a Wii. Very
exciting news that you finished your first

00:01:22.470 --> 00:01:29.400
draft of the as-yet-unnamed third book of
John Green, and also very good news that you

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:30.549
have a Wii

00:01:30.549 --> 00:01:38.000
Which leads me to the punishment. Someone
suggested that you send me your Wii as punishment,

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:47.270
ohohohhh, yeah! But! I am not that much of
a jerk. So, getting down to business, I have

00:01:47.270 --> 00:01:51.439
to come up with a punishment, and I got a
lot of them to choose from. Some people are

00:01:51.439 --> 00:01:55.020
calling you a standup citizen for agreeing
to do the punishment before I told you to

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:58.140
do the punishment. But you called me on the
phone and tried to convince me that it wasn’t

00:01:58.140 --> 00:02:01.420
a punishable offense that you sent me that
e-mail. I just wanted to set the record straight

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:02.420
on that one.

00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:06.310
Now the e-mail wasn’t really a personal
communication, so I can see why maybe a little

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:11.730
bit there’s some leeway there, so I’m
not gonna give you the worst punishments possible.

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:16.650
In fact, I think I’m gonna give you a choice.
And I honestly don’t know which one you

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:21.170
will choose, but you have to do one of the
two following things: Grow your facial hair

00:02:21.170 --> 00:02:28.260
for a week, and then wax your chin, or fill
a large bowl with Ben and Jerry’s ice cream

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:30.000
and then watch it melt.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:34.319
Additionally, I agree with the majority of
our commenters that "in my pants" is funnier

00:02:34.319 --> 00:02:40.420
than "in your pants" when it comes to Everyone
Poops. Everyone Poops in My Pants is a sad

00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:46.060
story, whereas Everyone Poops in Your Pants
is a funny story. And I think our viewers

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:51.200
will agree with me when I say that funny stories
about poop aren’t as funny as sad stories

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:58.700
about poop. And I am waiting in great anticipation
for the picture book Everyone Poops in My

00:02:58.700 --> 00:02:59.700
Pants.

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:02.890
John Green, I will see you tomorrow.

00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:06.490
Another Brotherhood 2.0 special feature is
upon us, and this one is slightly disturbing.

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:09.819
You might want to cover up the kiddies’
eyes; I am not doing what it looks like I’m

00:03:09.819 --> 00:03:11.110
